た塗りの雰囲気が大変好きでして、もし可能でしたらそのような方向性でお願いできると嬉しいです。\n\nお寿司屋さん漫画で初めてミヒラ先生のイラストを拝見して、それ以来ずっと憧れているイラストレーター様であり、私自身の絵柄にも多大な影響を及ぼした方なので、このような機会をいただけてとても嬉しいです。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 15767, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Mai 💐花擬人化創作", "screen_name": "balloon0903", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1997419594856923136/mz60qQXZ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/807587119686266880/1778345174/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 407634, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ひや", "screen_name": "Shiya47", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1860638037304360960/q_lLzVxw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1189716876/1696857513/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 607053, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ケーケミ🕴", "screen_name": "SAYAKA_IS_POWER", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1615612096817029123/ZxYmKXUR.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1092454923889913856/1673135028/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "co